# pulsar-trace v1
# clockRate=1789773 region=ntsc
# all eight voices at once: the 2A03's five (A major on the pulses and triangle, a
# noise hit at the half second, the looping DPCM ramp) with the VRC6's three stacked on
# top — C#5 and A5 on its pulses and E4 on its sawtooth, so every one of the eight is
# at its own frequency and none of them hides inside another's DFT bin. the 2A03 half
# compresses through the non-linear ladders while the VRC6 half sums linearly beside
# it, which is exactly the balance VRC6_GAIN is calibrated for.
